{"2100020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lou's Lagoon", "steam_appid": 2100020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4831360, 4890570, 5026610], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✈️ A Seaplane, a Storm, and a Missing Uncle</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies in your trusty seaplane on a heartfelt adventure across the tropical Limbo archipelago. After receiving a distress call from Uncle Lou, you arrive only to find the islands in disarray and Lou nowhere to be found. Collect resources, help rebuild a community, and unravel the mystery of your uncle’s disappearance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/a68fb9c0d31e116f83c591f9ada0802d.poster.avif?t=1787839211\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/a68fb9c0d31e116f83c591f9ada0802d.webm?t=1787839211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/a68fb9c0d31e116f83c591f9ada0802d.mp4?t=1787839211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️<strong><i>Collect, Craft, Restore</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the vacuum power of the Swirler! — a glorious multi-tool — to collect everything from scrap and native plants to materials dropped by Limbo’s unique wildlife. Use your finds to repair buildings, craft goods, and help the communities thrive again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim your slice of paradise at Lou’s Lagoon. Build your dream beach hut, add your personal touch, and let the island rhythm take over.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/78731a6ef7795db92f5ed0521b246c7b.poster.avif?t=1787839211\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/78731a6ef7795db92f5ed0521b246c7b.webm?t=1787839211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/78731a6ef7795db92f5ed0521b246c7b.mp4?t=1787839211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌴<strong><i> Meet the islanders of Limbo</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the archipelago’s vibrant islands, each with their own spirited communities, hidden treasures, and unique problems to solve. Get a warm welcome from the Charneys in Tangle Bloom—the archipelago's liveliest town—then head to Gleam Reef to watch the Vooi move to the music of the tides. Lastly, visit Boulderia, home to the grumpy, sugar-crystal-mining Gorplins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4ca3deccadcdec2d492b82437e825e22.poster.avif?t=1787839211\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4ca3deccadcdec2d492b82437e825e22.webm?t=1787839211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/4ca3deccadcdec2d492b82437e825e22.mp4?t=1787839211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌴 <strong>Explore the Limbo archipelago, </strong>home to vibrant communities and ancient secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛫 <strong>Pilot your very own seaplane</strong>, master ring challenges, and enjoy the freedom of open skies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌀Upgrade</strong> your gadgets to expand your adventures. Scoop, build, glide and fish! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️<strong>Personalize your seaplane</strong> with vibrant skins and custom configurations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Full character customization. </strong>Make your avatar uniquely yours, from hairstyle to outfits and accessories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ <strong>Build your island base, </strong>decorate it, and make Lou’s Lagoon feel like home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❔<strong>A mystery to unravel. </strong>Piece together clues, follow Lou’s trail, and uncover the truth behind his disappearance! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/6dd5da4d7f4cc6ae3b1a65370dbdefac.poster.avif?t=1787839211\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/6dd5da4d7f4cc6ae3b1a65370dbdefac.webm?t=1787839211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100020/extras/6dd5da4d7f4cc6ae3b1a65370dbdefac.mp4?t=1787839211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re hot on the trail to solving the mystery of Uncle Lou or just kicking back and enjoying island life, Lou’s Lagoon is your ticket to an exciting adventure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready for takeoff?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thanks to our partners:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\